Credit
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The classifier approach is inspired by TypeSafe's Jev (System One). We are not
affiliated with TypeSafe. We train our own models.

The checks layer includes an optional-to-enable provider that calls TypeSafe's
hosted Jev API (https://api.typesafe.ai). It is a network call to a commercial
third-party service, made only when an operator enables the checks layer and
supplies their own API key. No TypeSafe code and no model weights are bundled
in this repository. The local deterministic scorers in checks/ are what run
when that provider is unselected or unavailable.

